      "note": "Burst of Power (1801961 cast 6500, cd 52 s): an unavoidable hit on every player after a 6.5 s cast, spread apart. Official skill; the cone on each player is modelled as a circle (CANDIDATE). The Mortal Soulstone interrupt (NPCs 2920677/78) is NOT implemented.",
